 "descriptionHtml": "<p>A small heart, in your month&#x27;s colour. A fine gold cable chain carrying one small heart-cut stone in four slim claws, the chain fixed at the heart&#x27;s shoulders so it always sits straight. Choose the colour for your month, or for someone else&#x27;s.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Give it in the month&#x27;s colour, or layer two hearts for two birthdays.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Pendant: One heart cut cubic zirconia, approximately 7mm, in four slim gold claws</li>\n<li>Chain: Fine gold cable, fixed at the heart&#x27;s shoulders so it sits straight</li>\n<li>Length: Approximately 40cm plus extender</li>\n<li>Colours: January garnet, February amethyst, March aquamarine, April crystal, May emerald, June light amethyst, July ruby, August peridot, September sapphire, October rose, November topaz, December blue zircon</li>\n<li>Finish: Gold tone</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Keep it dry and away from perfume and harsh chemicals. Wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
